        "created_at": "2016-09-28T09:28:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Relatively easy mint. I had Looking up in Setback's initial draw, so that gave me a reliable damage source and a good source of unlucky tokens to fuel his other cards. Omni got both heal beams out on the first turn, then alternated between playing cards for Setback and Tachyon. Nightmist contributed a Mistbound and banished a couple jinxes. Did not get much help from Cosmic.</p>",
