        "id": 182896,
        "name": "deddragon",
        "username": "deddragon",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/deddragon/{size}/2335_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-09-29T00:52:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Minted here.<br>\nKismet played 5 Jinxes via Karmic Disjunction on her first turn, but they were all gone (one was a One-shot) before the next time she acted.<br>\nThe Temple played Mysterious Ceremonies on its first go, then on the second it played the other 2 Ceremonies and the Master, but I used a Play off of Ceremonies to take down the Master so I never saw True Form. I tried to set up Kismet for the Assassin on Nightmist’s turn, but I forgot I had a Dynamic Syphon at 2 HP so Setback drew 3 cards and then Ceremoniously Reckless Rushed her.</p>",
