        "created_at": "2016-10-03T03:30:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Easy mint. The only time anyone was in slight danger was the one hit she got on her flipped side and clobbered Omnitron, busting his Component. Setback got Looking Up out early and Karmic Retributioned her to finish things off.</p>",
